WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:07.831
"We'll get you out, angelfish!" Cora said.

2
00:00:07.832 --> 00:00:10.525
She wrapped her arms around the rock.

3
00:00:10.526 --> 00:00:14.194
She pulled with all her might.

4
00:00:14.195 --> 00:00:18.379
The rock didn't budge.

5
00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:27.455
Mo tried to help.

6
00:00:27.456 --> 00:00:30.607
"It's too heavy!" he said.

7
00:00:30.608 --> 00:00:35.914
"Help!" the angelfish cried.

8
00:00:35.915 --> 00:00:40.445
"I wish I had more arms," Cora said.

9
00:00:40.446 --> 00:00:43.056
"Then I could move the boulder!"

10
00:00:43.057 --> 00:00:48.162
Cora swam back and forth.

11
00:00:48.163 --> 00:00:51.117
"I know what to do!" Cora said.

12
00:00:51.118 --> 00:00:52.734
"Stay here, Mo.

13
00:00:52.735 --> 00:00:58.845
I'll be back soon!"

14
00:00:58.846 --> 00:01:07.884
Cora swam back to her den.

15
00:01:07.885 --> 00:01:11.460
"Did you find them?" Andy cried.

16
00:01:11.461 --> 00:01:14.475
"Yes, but they're trapped," Cora said.

17
00:01:14.476 --> 00:01:18.954
She looked around. "Where's Octo?"

18
00:01:18.955 --> 00:01:22.906
"He's juggling pebbles," Andy said.

19
00:01:22.907 --> 00:01:25.718
"Octo!" Cora called.

20
00:01:25.719 --> 00:01:31.309
"Here I come!" Octo raced in.

21
00:01:31.310 --> 00:01:34.380
"Slow down!" Cora said.

22
00:01:34.381 --> 00:01:40.526
"Uh-oh!" Octo gulped. "Am I in trouble?"

23
00:01:40.527 --> 00:01:43.793
"No." Cora put an arm around him.

24
00:01:43.794 --> 00:01:47.432
"I need your help freeing the angelfish."

25
00:01:47.433 --> 00:01:51.305
"Cool! Let's go!" Octo said.

26
00:01:51.306 --> 00:01:54.253
He started to swim away.

27
00:01:54.254 --> 00:01:57.780
"Wait." Cora pulled him back in.

28
00:01:57.781 --> 00:02:01.092
"You need to listen to my plan first."

29
00:02:01.093 --> 00:02:04.297
"Oh, okay," Octo said.

30
00:02:04.298 --> 00:02:07.491
"I'm listening, Cora!"

